{"data":{"ExtRef_Child_hu_note":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"（乙卯、五九五）","note_content_jianti_auto":"（乙卯、五九五）","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"b3ffba2d-db0e-11ef-b5d4-a0d3651f611f"},"ExtRef_Children_contents":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"齊州","place_name_jianti_auto":"齐州","place_note":"山东省济南市","resolved_place_entity_id":27,"start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"b3ffba2f-db0e-11ef-9dbc-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"泰山","place_name_jianti_auto":"泰山","place_note":"山东省泰安市北","resolved_place_entity_id":306,"start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"b3ffba30-db0e-11ef-8311-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/〇、封域 山川险要（卷三十）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"大业九年，齐郡丞张须陀击群贼王簿于泰山下，大破之。唐乾封...","context_before":"...曰越观，又名月观，以与日观相对也，与秦观为泰山三峰云]。","source_end_index":930,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"4fb08d4f-c3c0-5b48-be3b-5e70e4f4b948","source_start_index":900,"source_text":"隋开皇十五年，东巡，顿齐州，为坛于泰山，柴燎祀天，礼如南郊。"}],"path":"山东方舆纪要/〇、封域 山川险要（卷三十）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"1春，正月，壬戌，車駕頓齊州。庚午，爲壇於泰山，柴燎祀天，以歲旱謝愆咎，禮如南郊；又親祀青帝壇。赦天下。","content_fanyi":"春季，正月初三日壬戌，隋文帝的车驾停留在齐州。正月十一日庚午，在泰山上修筑祭坛，点燃柴燎祭祀上天，因年岁干旱而向上天谢罪请过，礼仪如同南郊祭天；又亲自祭祀青帝坛。大赦天下。","content_jianti_auto":"1春，正月，壬戌，车驾顿齐州。庚午，为坛于泰山，柴燎祀天，以岁旱谢愆咎，礼如南郊；又亲祀青帝坛。赦天下。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[{"excerpts":[{"context_after":"，作仁寿宫，而丁夫死者万计，别宫十二，相因营造，则其搜剔...","context_before":"...十年而盗贼竞起以亡隋。民之不辑也久矣，考其时，北筑长城，","source_end_index":311,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"df12381e-2bb4-4c16-bc13-031a100fa5d2","source_start_index":307,"source_text":"东巡泰岳"}],"title":"一一 隋均田乃虐民之政"}],"id":17259,"number":1,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"b3ffba2e-db0e-11ef-90bb-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"關","place_name_jianti_auto":"关","resolved_place_entity_id":133,"start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"b4005672-db0e-11ef-b8f9-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"2二月，丙辰，收天下兵器，敢私造者坐之；關中、綠邊不在其例。","content_fanyi":"二月二十七日丙辰，隋文帝下诏收缴天下兵器，有敢私自铸造兵器的依法治罪；关中和沿边地区不在此限令之内。","content_jianti_auto":"2二月，丙辰，收天下兵器，敢私造者坐之；关中、绿边不在其例。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":17260,"number":2,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"b4005671-db0e-11ef-80b7-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"3三月，己未，至自東巡。","content_fanyi":"三月初一日己未，隋文帝从东方巡视回到长安。","content_jianti_auto":"3三月，己未，至自东巡。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":17261,"number":3,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"b4005673-db0e-11ef-b2e7-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"高熲","people_name_jianti_auto":"高颎","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"b4005677-db0e-11ef-a0ae-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"素","people_name_jianti_auto":"素","start_index":39,"tongjian_id":"b4005678-db0e-11ef-9f90-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"獨孤皇后","people_name_jianti_auto":"独孤皇后","start_index":47,"tongjian_id":"b4005679-db0e-11ef-b670-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"考異曰：隋書、北史皆曰：「宮成，上令高熲前視，奏稱頗傷綺麗，大損人丁，帝不悅。素懼，卽於北門啓獨孤皇后曰，『帝王法有離宮別館，今天下太平，造一宮何足損費！』后以此理諭上，上乃解。」今從唐書。","note_content_jianti_auto":"考异曰：隋书、北史皆曰：「宫成，上令高颎前视，奏称颇伤绮丽，大损人丁，帝不悦。素惧，即于北门启独孤皇后曰，『帝王法有离宫别馆，今天下太平，造一宫何足损费！』后以此理谕上，上乃解。」今从唐书。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":108,"tongjian_id":"b4005676-db0e-11ef-a9e1-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"楊素","people_name_jianti_auto":"杨素","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"b4005680-db0e-11ef-956a-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"封德彝","people_name_jianti_auto":"封德彝","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"b4005681-db0e-11ef-af5d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"楊素賞重封德彝，非但以其算略，蓋心術亦相似。","note_content_jianti_auto":"杨素赏重封德彝，非但以其算略，盖心术亦相似。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":209,"tongjian_id":"b400567f-db0e-11ef-a9e5-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"中枢机构","official_name":"宰相","official_note":"宰相是古代中国中央政府最高行政长官，负责辅佐皇帝处理国家政务。在《资治通鉴》此段中，杨素与封德彝讨论宰相的职责，反映了宰相在隋朝政治体系中的核心地位，常由重臣担任，如杨素本人曾为尚书令等职。","official_rank":"正一品至正三品","source_snippet":"與論宰相職務","start_index":149,"tongjian_id":"24c214c3-3774-493c-870c-a348885f42e3"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"中枢机构","official_name":"內史舍人","official_note":"内史舍人是隋朝内史省（后改称中书省）的官员，负责起草诏令、文书处理等机要事务。在此段中，封德彝被皇帝提拔为内史舍人，表明他因杨素的推荐而进入中央核心机构，参与国家政令的制定。","official_rank":"从五品至从六品","source_snippet":"帝擢爲內史舍人","start_index":184,"tongjian_id":"9709b3c4-b9d2-4b4c-b831-866461de4f51"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":544,"link_death_year":606,"link_td_description":"杨素，字处道，弘农郡华阴县人，出自弘农杨氏越公房，北周、隋朝军事家、诗人。","link_td_id":"Q10008547","link_td_number_id":321425,"people_name":"楊素","people_name_jianti_auto":"杨素","people_xingming":"杨素","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"b4005682-db0e-11ef-ae05-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":544,"link_death_year":606,"link_td_description":"杨素，字处道，弘农郡华阴县人，出自弘农杨氏越公房，北周、隋朝军事家、诗人。","link_td_id":"Q10008547","link_td_number_id":321425,"people_name":"楊素","people_name_jianti_auto":"杨素","start_index":56,"tongjian_id":"b4005683-db0e-11ef-877f-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":544,"link_death_year":606,"link_td_description":"杨素，字处道，弘农郡华阴县人，出自弘农杨氏越公房，北周、隋朝军事家、诗人。","link_td_id":"Q10008547","link_td_number_id":321425,"people_name":"素","people_name_jianti_auto":"素","start_index":73,"tongjian_id":"b4005686-db0e-11ef-9826-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":568,"link_death_year":627,"link_td_description":"封德彝，名伦，字德彝，以字行，观州蓨县（今河北景县）人，隋朝、唐朝官员。","link_td_id":"Q10001972","link_td_number_id":1041055,"people_name":"封德彝","people_name_jianti_auto":"封德彝","people_xingming":"封德彝","start_index":86,"tongjian_id":"b4005687-db0e-11ef-a081-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":544,"link_death_year":606,"link_td_description":"杨素，字处道，弘农郡华阴县人，出自弘农杨氏越公房，北周、隋朝军事家、诗人。","link_td_id":"Q10008547","link_td_number_id":321425,"people_name":"素","people_name_jianti_auto":"素","people_xingming":"杨素","start_index":114,"tongjian_id":"b4005688-db0e-11ef-911c-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":544,"link_death_year":602,"link_td_description":"独孤伽罗，河南郡洛阳县（今河南省洛阳市东）人，北周太保、大宗伯独孤信的七女，母崔氏，隋朝开国皇帝隋文帝的妻子，北周宣帝皇后杨丽华、杨勇、隋炀帝杨广、杨俊、杨秀、杨谅的母亲，唐高祖李渊的姨母。隋文帝即位之后，封为皇后。","link_td_id":"Q10000639","link_td_number_id":287440,"people_name":"獨孫后","people_name_jianti_auto":"独孙后","people_xingming":"独孤皇后","start_index":118,"tongjian_id":"b4005689-db0e-11ef-9d15-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":544,"link_death_year":606,"link_td_description":"杨素，字处道，弘农郡华阴县人，出自弘农杨氏越公房，北周、隋朝军事家、诗人。","link_td_id":"Q10008547","link_td_number_id":321425,"people_name":"素","people_name_jianti_auto":"素","people_xingming":"杨素","start_index":160,"tongjian_id":"b400568a-db0e-11ef-a9e3-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":568,"link_death_year":627,"link_td_description":"封德彝，名伦，字德彝，以字行，观州蓨县（今河北景县）人，隋朝、唐朝官员。","link_td_id":"Q10001972","link_td_number_id":1041055,"people_name":"德彝","people_name_jianti_auto":"德彝","people_xingming":"封德彝","start_index":174,"tongjian_id":"b400568b-db0e-11ef-9444-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":568,"link_death_year":627,"link_td_description":"封德彝，名伦，字德彝，以字行，观州蓨县（今河北景县）人，隋朝、唐朝官员。","link_td_id":"Q10001972","link_td_number_id":1041055,"people_name":"封郞","people_name_jianti_auto":"封郞","people_xingming":"封德彝","start_index":199,"tongjian_id":"b400568c-db0e-11ef-b043-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"仁壽宮","place_name_jianti_auto":"仁寿宫","place_note":"陕西省麟游县境","resolved_place_entity_id":1214,"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"b4005684-db0e-11ef-8a47-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"仁壽宮","place_name_jianti_auto":"仁寿宫","resolved_place_entity_id":1214,"start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"b4005685-db0e-11ef-bbb3-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政","人事"],"content":"4仁壽宮成。丁亥，上幸仁壽宮。時天暑，役夫死者相次於道，楊素悉焚除之，上聞之，不悅。及至，見制度壯麗，大怒曰：「楊素殫民力爲離宮，爲吾結怨天下。」素聞之，惶恐，慮獲譴，以告封德彝，曰：「公勿憂，俟皇后至，必有恩詔。」明日，上果召素入對，獨孫后勞之曰：「公知吾夫婦老，無以自娛，盛飾此宮，豈非忠孝！」賜錢百萬，錦絹三千段。素負貴恃才，多所陵侮；唯賞重德彝，每引之與論宰相職務，終日忘倦，因撫其牀曰：「封郞必須據吾此坐。」屢薦於帝，帝擢爲內史舍人。","content_fanyi":"仁寿宫建成。三月二十九日丁亥，隋文帝前往仁寿宫。当时天气炎热，役夫一个接一个死在路上，杨素把尸体全部清除并焚烧掩埋，隋文帝听说后很不高兴。等到了仁寿宫，看见宫殿规模宏伟壮丽，勃然大怒说：“杨素耗尽民力修建离宫，替我招来天下人的怨恨。”杨素听说后惶恐不安，担心受到责罚，便去告诉土木监封德彝。封德彝说：“您不必担忧，等皇后到来，一定会有恩赏诏书。”第二天，隋文帝果然召杨素入宫奏对，独孤皇后慰劳他说：“您知道我们夫妇年老，没有什么可供娱乐，特意盛加装饰这座宫殿，难道不是忠孝吗！”于是赏赐钱一百万、锦绢三千段。杨素自恃地位尊贵、富有才干，对朝臣多有欺凌侮辱，唯独赏识器重封德彝，常常请他来一起议论宰相的职责，整日谈论而忘记疲倦，又抚着自己的坐榻说：“封郎将来一定继承我这个座位。”他多次向隋文帝推荐封德彝，隋文帝便提拔封德彝为内史舍人。","content_jianti_auto":"4仁寿宫成。丁亥，上幸仁寿宫。时天暑，役夫死者相次于道，杨素悉焚除之，上闻之，不悦。及至，见制度壮丽，大怒曰：「杨素殚民力为离宫，为吾结怨天下。」素闻之，惶恐，虑获谴，以告封德彝，曰：「公勿忧，俟皇后至，必有恩诏。」明日，上果召素入对，独孙后劳之曰：「公知吾夫妇老，无以自娱，盛饰此宫，岂非忠孝！」赐钱百万，锦绢三千段。素负贵恃才，多所陵侮；唯赏重德彝，每引之与论宰相职务，终日忘倦，因抚其床曰：「封郞必须据吾此坐。」屡荐于帝，帝擢为内史舍人。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[{"excerpts":[{"context_after":"耳目之欲，力制而不能制也；盗边粮者升以上皆斩，积聚之贪，...","context_before":"奚以明其然邪？","source_end_index":22,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"d0479722-9e36-40d5-bb77-81cd2310eee8","source_start_index":7,"source_text":"仁寿宫成，赏封德彝而擢为内史。"},{"context_after":"。耳目之欲，力制而不能制也；盗边粮者升以上皆斩，积聚之贪...","context_before":"奚以明其然邪？","source_end_index":21,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"d0479722-9e36-40d5-bb77-81cd2310eee8","source_start_index":7,"source_text":"仁寿宫成，赏封德彝而擢为内史"}],"title":"一五 大俭之后乃生奢男"}],"id":17262,"number":4,"reading_annotation_sources":[{"count":1,"source":"资治通鉴考异","source_key":"资治通鉴考异"}],"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"b4005674-db0e-11ef-a4a2-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"5夏，四月，己丑朔，赦天下。","content_fanyi":"夏季，四月初一日己丑，大赦天下。","content_jianti_auto":"5夏，四月，己丑朔，赦天下。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":17263,"number":5,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"b400568d-db0e-11ef-bcb4-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"禹","people_name_jianti_auto":"禹","start_index":34,"tongjian_id":"b400f2f9-db0e-11ef-849a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"底柱山","place_name_jianti_auto":"底柱山","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"b400f2fa-db0e-11ef-a6b5-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"陝縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"陕县","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"b400f2fb-db0e-11ef-a099-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"大河","place_name_jianti_auto":"大河","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"b400f2fc-db0e-11ef-af8e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"河水","place_name_jianti_auto":"河水","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"b400f2fd-db0e-11ef-a6aa-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"砥柱門","place_name_jianti_auto":"砥柱门","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"b400f2fe-db0e-11ef-9659-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"砥柱","place_name_jianti_auto":"砥柱","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"b400f2ff-db0e-11ef-9809-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"河","place_name_jianti_auto":"河","start_index":52,"tongjian_id":"b400f300-db0e-11ef-af8a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"河水","place_name_jianti_auto":"河水","start_index":54,"tongjian_id":"b400f301-db0e-11ef-9be9-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"砥柱","place_name_jianti_auto":"砥柱","start_index":74,"tongjian_id":"b400f302-db0e-11ef-b8e2-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"三門","place_name_jianti_auto":"三门","start_index":95,"tongjian_id":"b400f303-db0e-11ef-9537-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"底柱山，在陝縣北大河中。水經曰：河水過砥柱門。註云：砥柱，山名也。昔禹治洪水，山陵當水者鑿之，故破山以通河，河水分流，包山而過，山見水中若柱然，故曰砥柱。三穿旣決，水流疏分，指狀表目，亦謂之三門。","note_content_jianti_auto":"底柱山，在陕县北大河中。水经曰：河水过砥柱门。注云：砥柱，山名也。昔禹治洪水，山陵当水者凿之，故破山以通河，河水分流，包山而过，山见水中若柱然，故曰砥柱。三穿既决，水流疏分，指状表目，亦谓之三门。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"b400568f-db0e-11ef-a4c1-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"底柱","place_name_jianti_auto":"底柱","place_note":"河南三门峡市北黄河河道中央","resolved_place_entity_id":3729,"start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"b400f306-db0e-11ef-add7-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/〇、封域山川险要（卷四十六）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"大业七年，底柱崩，偃河逆流数十里。唐贞观二十年，幸河北[...","context_before":"...，经底柱之险，达于常平者[常平仓，置于陕州]，免其征戍。","source_end_index":559,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"3435fecb-528a-5818-a498-00f3e4d9ad43","source_start_index":550,"source_text":"十五年，诏凿底柱。"}],"path":"河南方舆纪要/〇、封域山川险要（卷四十六）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"6六月，戊子，詔鑿底柱。","content_fanyi":"六月初一日戊子，隋文帝下诏开凿砥柱山。","content_jianti_auto":"6六月，戊子，诏凿底柱。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":17264,"number":6,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"b400568e-db0e-11ef-a430-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"慕容精","people_name_jianti_auto":"慕容精","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"b400f309-db0e-11ef-8626-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"燕","place_name_jianti_auto":"燕","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"b400f30a-db0e-11ef-a031-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"b400f30b-db0e-11ef-85ee-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"燕慕容精歸魏，北人謂歸義爲豆盧，子孫以爲氏。相，息亮翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"燕慕容精归魏，北人谓归义为豆卢，子孙以为氏。相，息亮翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"b400f308-db0e-11ef-b80e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"相州刺史","official_note":"相州刺史是隋朝时期相州的地方行政长官，负责管理该州的政务、司法和军事等事务。在《资治通鉴》此段中，豆盧通担任此职，并因进贡绫文布而被命令在朝堂焚烧，反映了当时对奢侈品的禁令或皇帝对节俭的强调。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"相州刺史豆盧通貢綾文布","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"e34dfdca-7181-487c-b7b5-a5deb45c397d"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":539,"link_death_year":597,"link_td_description":"豆卢通，一名会，字平东，昌黎郡徒河县（今辽宁省锦州市）人，北周、隋朝官员。","link_td_id":"Q10018906","link_td_number_id":5704154,"people_name":"豆盧通","people_name_jianti_auto":"豆卢通","people_xingming":"豆卢通","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"b400f30d-db0e-11ef-bcee-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"相州","place_name_jianti_auto":"相州","place_note":"河南省安阳市","resolved_place_entity_id":351,"start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"b400f30e-db0e-11ef-839e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"7庚寅，相州刺史豆盧通貢綾文布，命焚之於朝堂。","content_fanyi":"六月初三日庚寅，相州刺史豆卢通进贡绫纹布，隋文帝命令在朝堂上将布焚毁。","content_jianti_auto":"7庚寅，相州刺史豆卢通贡绫文布，命焚之于朝堂。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":17265,"number":7,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"b400f307-db0e-11ef-bddf-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"中枢机构","official_name":"納言","official_note":"納言是隋朝官職，源自古代侍中，負責傳達皇帝詔令和審議政事，屬於門下省長官。在《資治通鑑》此段中，蘇威擔任納言，因從祠泰山不敬而被免職，後又復位，顯示其官職變動。","official_rank":"正三品","source_snippet":"納言蘇威坐從祠泰山不敬，免，俄而復位。","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"9093f11b-15e1-4745-9f96-859470572dce"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"蘇威","people_name_jianti_auto":"苏威","people_xingming":"苏威","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"b400f311-db0e-11ef-b285-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"蘇威","people_name_jianti_auto":"苏威","people_xingming":"苏威","start_index":35,"tongjian_id":"b400f312-db0e-11ef-b7d9-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"泰山","place_name_jianti_auto":"泰山","resolved_place_entity_id":306,"start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"b400f313-db0e-11ef-b0e9-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["人事"],"content":"8秋，七月，納言蘇威坐從祠泰山不敬，免，俄而復位。上謂羣臣曰：「世人言蘇威詐清，家累金玉，此妄言也。然其性狠戾，不切世要，求名太甚，從己則悅，違之必怒，此其大病耳。」","content_fanyi":"秋季七月，纳言苏威因随从隋文帝祭祀泰山时犯下不敬之罪而被免职，不久又恢复职位。隋文帝对群臣说：“世人都说苏威假装清廉，家中却积满金玉财宝，这纯属胡言乱语。然而他生性凶狠暴戾，不近人情，求名之心过重；顺从自己的，他就喜欢；违背自己的，他就恼怒。这是他最大的毛病。”","content_jianti_auto":"8秋，七月，纳言苏威坐从祠泰山不敬，免，俄而复位。上谓群臣曰：「世人言苏威诈清，家累金玉，此妄言也。然其性狠戾，不切世要，求名太甚，从己则悦，违之必怒，此其大病耳。」","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":17266,"number":8,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"b400f30f-db0e-11ef-a102-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"仁壽宮","place_name_jianti_auto":"仁寿宫","resolved_place_entity_id":1214,"start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"b400f315-db0e-11ef-8d07-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"9戊寅，上至自仁壽宮。","content_fanyi":"七月二十二日戊寅，隋文帝从仁寿宫回到长安。","content_jianti_auto":"9戊寅，上至自仁寿宫。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":17267,"number":9,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"b400f314-db0e-11ef-b670-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"韋洸","people_name_jianti_auto":"韦洸","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"b400f318-db0e-11ef-b5f2-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"世康","people_name_jianti_auto":"世康","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"b400f319-db0e-11ef-b7f4-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"洸","people_name_jianti_auto":"洸","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"b400f31a-db0e-11ef-8619-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"嶺","place_name_jianti_auto":"岭","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"b400f31b-db0e-11ef-b83a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"韋洸安輯嶺南，卒于官。按隋書·世康傳：世康，洸之兄。洸，古黃翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"韦洸安辑岭南，卒于官。按隋书·世康传：世康，洸之兄。洸，古黄翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"b400f317-db0e-11ef-ac80-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"襄州","place_name_jianti_auto":"襄州","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"b400f31e-db0e-11ef-9d8a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"安州","place_name_jianti_auto":"安州","start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"b400f31f-db0e-11ef-83b0-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"信州","place_name_jianti_auto":"信州","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"b400f320-db0e-11ef-b37c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"按世康傳，自禮部尚書轉吏部尚書，在開皇四年之前。七年拜襄州刺史，歷安州、信州總管，十三年入朝，復拜吏部尚書。出入踐揚，前後十餘年，不專在吏部也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"按世康传，自礼部尚书转吏部尚书，在开皇四年之前。七年拜襄州刺史，历安州、信州总管，十三年入朝，复拜吏部尚书。出入践扬，前后十余年，不专在吏部也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":49,"tongjian_id":"b400f31d-db0e-11ef-b2b6-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"中枢机构","official_name":"吏部尚書","official_note":"吏部尚書是隋朝中央六部之一吏部的长官，负责官员的选拔、考核和任免，属于高级文官。在原文中，韦世康原任此职，后被任命为荆州总管，体现了官职的调动。","official_rank":"正三品","source_snippet":"以吏部尚書韋世康爲荊州總管","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"cb6261cb-7820-41be-931d-f76f81a92295"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"荊州總管","official_note":"荊州總管是隋朝地方行政和军事长官，负责荆州地区的治理和防御，属于高级地方官职。在原文中，韦世康被任命为此职，反映了隋朝对地方的控制和官员的调配。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"以吏部尚書韋世康爲荊州總管","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"ab68b2ea-8560-4f3a-b287-19c91c63872e"},{"confidence":0.85,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"總管","official_note":"總管是隋朝时期的地方军政长官，通常负责一个或多个州的行政和军事事务，权力较大。在原文中，提到天下只有四个总管，包括并、扬、益、荆，说明这是重要的地方职位。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"時天下惟有四總管，幷、揚、益、荊","start_index":85,"tongjian_id":"3c8c2b93-de10-4cb4-9380-cf9736518f95"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"韋世康","people_name_jianti_auto":"韦世康","people_xingming":"韦世康","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"b400f322-db0e-11ef-8718-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"世康","people_name_jianti_auto":"世康","people_xingming":"韦世康","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"b400f323-db0e-11ef-8b61-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":590,"link_td_description":"韦洸，一名汪，字世穆，京兆郡杜陵县（今陕西省西安市长安区）人，出自京兆韦氏逍遥公房，北周、隋朝官员。","link_td_id":"Q10017605","link_td_number_id":5183744,"people_name":"洸","people_name_jianti_auto":"洸","people_xingming":"韦洸","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"b400f324-db0e-11ef-ac33-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"世康","people_name_jianti_auto":"世康","people_xingming":"韦世康","start_index":124,"tongjian_id":"b400f326-db0e-11ef-8741-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"荊州","place_name_jianti_auto":"荆州","resolved_place_entity_id":145,"start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"b400f325-db0e-11ef-a61b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"荊州","place_name_jianti_auto":"荆州","resolved_place_entity_id":145,"start_index":95,"tongjian_id":"b400f327-db0e-11ef-bb86-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"幷","place_name_jianti_auto":"幷","resolved_place_entity_id":186,"start_index":107,"tongjian_id":"b400f328-db0e-11ef-b406-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"揚","place_name_jianti_auto":"扬","place_note":"总部设扬州【江苏省扬州市】","resolved_place_entity_id":432,"start_index":109,"tongjian_id":"b400f329-db0e-11ef-95b5-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"益","place_name_jianti_auto":"益","place_note":"总部设益州【四川省成都市】","resolved_place_entity_id":204,"start_index":111,"tongjian_id":"b400f32a-db0e-11ef-ba6b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"荊","place_name_jianti_auto":"荆","place_note":"总部设荆州","resolved_place_entity_id":103,"start_index":113,"tongjian_id":"b400f32b-db0e-11ef-94b9-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"晉","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋","resolved_place_entity_id":111,"start_index":116,"tongjian_id":"b400f32c-db0e-11ef-99ff-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","resolved_place_entity_id":24,"start_index":118,"tongjian_id":"b400f32d-db0e-11ef-807e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"蜀","place_name_jianti_auto":"蜀","resolved_place_entity_id":38,"start_index":120,"tongjian_id":"b400f32e-db0e-11ef-bbf3-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["人事"],"content":"10冬，十月，戊子，以吏部尚書韋世康爲荊州總管。世康，洸之弟也，和靜謙恕，在吏部十餘年，時稱廉平。常有止足之志，謂子弟曰：「祿豈須多，防滿則退；年不待暮，有疾便辭。」因懇乞骸骨。帝不許，使鎭荊州。時天下惟有四總管，幷、揚、益、荊，以晉、秦、蜀三王及世康爲之，當時以爲榮。","content_fanyi":"冬季，十月初三日戊子，任命吏部尚书韦世康为荆州总管。韦世康是韦洸的弟弟，性情平和安静，谦逊宽厚，在吏部任职十多年，当时的人都称赞他廉洁公正。他常有知足知止之心，对子弟们说：“俸禄何必求多，防止盈满就应退让；年岁不必等到晚年，有病就应辞官。”因此恳请告老还乡。隋文帝没有允许，派他镇守荆州。当时全国只设置四位总管，即并州、扬州、益州、荆州，分别由晋王杨广、秦王杨俊、蜀王杨秀和韦世康担任，当时人们把这件事看作韦世康的荣耀。","content_jianti_auto":"10冬，十月，戊子，以吏部尚书韦世康为荆州总管。世康，洸之弟也，和静谦恕，在吏部十余年，时称廉平。常有止足之志，谓子弟曰：「禄岂须多，防满则退；年不待暮，有疾便辞。」因恳乞骸骨。帝不许，使镇荆州。时天下惟有四总管，幷、扬、益、荆，以晋、秦、蜀三王及世康为之，当时以为荣。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":17268,"number":10,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"b400f316-db0e-11ef-8bb7-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"程大昌","people_name_jianti_auto":"程大昌","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"b4018f10-db0e-11ef-a693-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"宇文護","people_name_jianti_auto":"宇文护","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"b4018f11-db0e-11ef-8eba-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"隋文帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"隋文帝","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"b4018f12-db0e-11ef-bdcf-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"驪山","place_name_jianti_auto":"骊山","place_note":"陕西临潼东南","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"b4018f13-db0e-11ef-9b5b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"皇堂石井","place_name_jianti_auto":"皇堂石井","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"b4018f14-db0e-11ef-b9c2-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"後周","place_name_jianti_auto":"后周","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"b4018f15-db0e-11ef-82cf-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"驪山溫湯也。程大昌曰：皇堂石井，後周宇文護所造，隋文帝又修屋宇，幷植松栢千餘株。","note_content_jianti_auto":"骊山温汤也。程大昌曰：皇堂石井，后周宇文护所造，隋文帝又修屋宇，幷植松栢千余株。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"b4018f0f-db0e-11ef-af4f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/一、西安府（卷五十三）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"唐武德六年，亦幸骊山温汤。贞观四年，复幸焉。自是岁，常临...","context_before":"...大象初，天元如温汤。隋文帝时，更修屋宇，并植松柏千余株。","source_end_index":124,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"a4a44d68-6f73-5931-b32a-1dd37a9d6a9f","source_start_index":114,"source_text":"开皇十五年，幸温汤。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/一、西安府（卷五十三）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"11十一月，辛酉，上幸溫湯。","content_fanyi":"十一月初七日辛酉，隋文帝巡幸骊山温泉。","content_jianti_auto":"11十一月，辛酉，上幸温汤。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":17269,"number":11,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"b4018f0e-db0e-11ef-b393-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"考異曰：刑法志，事在十六年。今從帝紀。","note_content_jianti_auto":"考异曰：刑法志，事在十六年。今从帝纪。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"b4018f17-db0e-11ef-9d4f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"12十二月，戊子，敕：「盜邊糧一升已上，皆斬，仍籍沒其家。」","content_fanyi":"十二月初四日戊子，隋文帝下敕令说：“凡是偷盗边境军粮一升以上的，一律斩首，并且查抄其全部家产。”","content_jianti_auto":"12十二月，戊子，敕：「盗边粮一升已上，皆斩，仍籍没其家。」","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[{"excerpts":[{"context_after":"，积聚之贪，夸富强而唯恐不丰也。宋武藏农服以示子孙，齐高...","context_before":"...仁寿宫成，赏封德彝而擢为内史。耳目之欲，力制而不能制也；","source_end_index":44,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"d0479722-9e36-40d5-bb77-81cd2310eee8","source_start_index":35,"source_text":"盗边粮者升以上皆斩"}],"title":"一五 大俭之后乃生奢男"}],"id":17270,"number":12,"reading_annotation_sources":[{"count":1,"source":"资治通鉴考异","source_key":"资治通鉴考异"}],"start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"b4018f16-db0e-11ef-9ede-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"唐","people_name_jianti_auto":"唐","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"b4018f1d-db0e-11ef-ad61-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"虞","people_name_jianti_auto":"虞","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"b4018f1e-db0e-11ef-8908-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"唐、虞以三年爲一考，後世以一年爲一考。","note_content_jianti_auto":"唐、虞以三年为一考，后世以一年为一考。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"b4018f1c-db0e-11ef-920c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"中枢机构","official_name":"文武官","official_note":"文武官泛指文官和武官，是官员的统称，此处指所有官员需按四年考核制度进行轮替。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"詔文武官以