州刺史是隋朝地方行政官职，负责管理汴州（今河南开封一带）的民政、司法等事务。在上下文中，令孤熙担任此职，因考绩优异来朝受赏，体现了地方官员的考核与奖励机制。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"汴州刺史令孤熙來朝","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"5a82c742-4204-4cfa-905b-a8cc49d9c3c4"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":540,"link_death_year":602,"link_td_description":"令狐熙，字长熙，宜州华原县（今陕西省铜川市耀州区）人，令狐整之子。","link_td_id":"Q10009713","link_td_number_id":811017,"people_name":"令孤熙","people_name_jianti_auto":"令孤熙","people_xingming":"令狐熙","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"b4018f32-db0e-11ef-95a0-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":540,"link_death_year":602,"link_td_description":"令狐熙，字长熙，宜州华原县（今陕西省铜川市耀州区）人，令狐整之子。","link_td_id":"Q10009713","link_td_number_id":811017,"people_name":"熙","people_name_jianti_auto":"熙","people_xingming":"令狐熙","start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"b4018f34-db0e-11ef-9f91-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":513,"link_death_year":573,"link_td_description":"令狐整，本名延，字延保，敦煌郡效穀縣（今甘肃省酒泉市瓜州县）人，北魏、西魏、北周官员。","link_td_id":"Q10004886","link_td_number_id":810004,"people_name":"整","people_name_jianti_auto":"整","people_xingming":"令狐整","start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"b4018f35-db0e-11ef-821c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"汴州","place_name_jianti_auto":"汴州","place_note":"河南省开封市","resolved_place_entity_id":257,"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"b4018f33-db0e-11ef-8535-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["人事"],"content":"14汴州刺史令孤熙來朝，考績爲天下之最，賜帛三百匹，頒告天下。熙，整之子也。","content_fanyi":"汴州刺史令狐熙考满入京朝见，政绩考核居天下第一，隋文帝赏赐给他帛三百匹，并颁令通告全国嘉奖。令狐熙是令狐整的儿子。","content_jianti_auto":"14汴州刺史令孤熙来朝，考绩为天下之最，赐帛三百匹，颁告天下。熙，整之子也。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":17272,"number":14,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"b4018f1f-db0e-11ef-b300-a0d3651f611f"}],"reign_name":"十五年","reign_name_jianti_auto":"十五年","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"b3ffba2c-db0e-11ef-b855-a0d3651f611f","year_anno":"（乙卯、五九五）","y